        "seo_content": "<h3>What is the Klawford Hybrid 3000?</h3><p>The Klawford Hybrid 3000 is a premium 31 cm hybrid mattress that combines a high-compression zoned pocket spring system with 3 cm of cooling gel memory foam and supportive orthopaedic layers. It is designed to deliver premium comfort, targeted support, and excellent motion isolation — making it an ideal choice for couples, side sleepers, and back sleepers alike.</p><h3>What is a zoned pocket spring system?</h3><p>A zoned pocket spring system uses springs of different gauges in different areas of the mattress to provide targeted support. The Hybrid 3000 uses stronger 2.2 mm edge springs around the perimeter for reinforced edge support, and responsive 2.0 mm centre springs across the main sleeping area for balanced body support. Each spring responds independently to the pressure applied to it, so you get precisely the right level of support where your body needs it most.</p><h3>What does the cooling gel memory foam do?</h3><p>The 3 cm layer of cooling gel memory foam contours to the shape of your body, cushioning pressure points at the shoulders, hips, and lower back. The gel-infused material also helps regulate your sleeping temperature by drawing warmth away from the surface, keeping you comfortable throughout the night — without the heat retention that standard memory foam can sometimes cause.</p><h3>Who is the Hybrid 3000 suitable for?</h3><p>The Klawford Hybrid 3000 is designed for couples who want excellent motion isolation, side sleepers who need pressure relief at the shoulders and hips, back sleepers who benefit from a supportive spring foundation, and anyone looking for a premium, hotel-grade sleeping experience. The combination of pocket springs and memory foam means it works well across a range of sleeping positions and body types.</p><h3>What does reinforced edge support mean?</h3><p>Reinforced edge support means the perimeter of the mattress uses stronger springs — in this case 2.2 mm edge springs — to provide a firmer, more stable border around the entire mattress. This reduces the risk of rolling off the edge during sleep, maximises the usable sleeping surface, and gives the mattress a cleaner, more structured appearance. It also makes it more comfortable to sit on the edge of the bed.</p><h3>What sizes is the Hybrid 3000 available in?</h3><p>The Klawford Hybrid 3000 is available in all standard UK sizes — Small Single (2ft 6), Single (3ft), Small Double (4ft), Double (4ft 6), King (5ft), and Super King (6ft). Select your preferred size using the size selector on the product page.</p><h3>Is delivery free on the Hybrid 3000?</h3><p>Yes — free delivery is included with every Klawford Hybrid 3000 purchase. We deliver to the room of your choice, so you do not need to manage heavy packaging on your own. You can select your preferred delivery date at checkout. The mattress also comes with a 60-night risk-free trial — if it is not right for you, contact us and we will arrange a return and full refund.</p><h3>Can I spread the cost of the Hybrid 3000?</h3><p>Yes — we offer 0% interest-free financing through DivideBuy, letting you spread the cost over up to 12 months at no extra charge. Klarna is also available at checkout for pay-later or 3-payment options. Select your preferred payment method when you proceed to checkout.</p>",
